{
  "fixture_version": 2,
  "title": "NICK-592 parsing / status-detection specification",
  "description": [
    "Committed, versioned pin of breeding_core.parse_observation() and the",
    "field-update half of breeding_core.update_plant(). This is the contract",
    "that the Phase 2 markdown migration must NOT change: Task 2.1 swapped the",
    "persistence backend (tracker.json -> project.md + plants/<ID>.md) and",
    "nothing else, so every value below must hold identically before and after.",
    "",
    "PROVENANCE: the status vocabulary is documented in breeding_core.py's",
    "module docstring (NICK-592 consolidation; NICK-589 caught Mule Fuel, Lantz",
    "and Spaced Paste missing keeper/culled detection entirely). The exhaustive",
    "case-by-case expectations were DERIVED from the JSON-era source at git",
    "commit 2dd0537 ('Baseline: monitor-core as of pre-Phase-2'), whose",
    "parse_observation() and update_plant() field logic are byte-identical to",
    "today's; tests/test_nick592_parsing_spec.py re-derives them differentially",
    "against that baseline rather than trusting this file alone.",
    "",
    "plant_after is the result of applying update_plant()'s field-merge to a",
    "fresh make_blank_plant() record (vigor=None, terpene_notes=None,",
    "status='active'). summary is update_plant()'s returned string, with the",
    "plant id rendered as {pid}."
  ],
